{"id":937782,"title":"结课测试｜来赴一场满分之约！","content":"<p>你好，我是陈磊。</p>\n<p>《AI重塑测试开发系统实践》正式结课了，为认真学习的你点赞！为了帮你检验自己的学习成果，我特意准备了一套结课测试题。题目共有 20 道，10道单选题，10道多选题，满分 100 分，快来挑战一下吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=9300&exam_id=20928\"><img src=\"./images/937782_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>最后，我还给你准备了一个<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/aNS0Ek\">结课问卷</a>，希望你可以抽几分钟填一下，主要是想听听你对这门课的看法和建议。期待你的反馈！</p>\n<!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":407176,"user_name":"Zachary","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1646912,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"E66601808EE2E9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/21/40/30f9a8eb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1777187151,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101096201,"comment_content":"1","like_count":0}]}